","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:223758","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c110155","characterName":"日野 瑛巳","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"115676","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"387623"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24286"],"vndbCharacterId":"c110155"},"originalCharacterName":"日野 瑛巳","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist's older sister. She is a 2nd year student at Honoue Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She hangs out too often with her friends. As a result, her grades are really bad."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Everytime she gets frustrated, she teases her brother to vent out her anger. But in reality she really loves her younger brother."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Eimi doesn't like it when her brother gets along with other girls. It makes her irritated and her teasing gets worse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110155"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。穂之上学園二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔太の姉で、穂之上学園二年生。黒ギャルで、友達と遊び惚けている為、成績は良くない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"うっぷんが溜まると、いつも翔太をイジッて発散するが、本当は弟の事が大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔太が、他の女子とイチャイチャするとかなり不機嫌になり、その後のイジリが酷くなる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24286","sourceWorkId":"32819","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穂之上学園二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔太の姉で、穂之上学園二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"黒ギャルで、友達と遊び惚けている為、成績は良くない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"うっぷんが溜まると、いつも翔太をイジッて発散するが、本当は弟の事が大好き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"翔太が、他の女子とイチャイチャするとかなり不機嫌になり、その後のイジリが酷くなる。。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"115676"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://