em immediately."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She really loves to tease the protagonist, and when Eimi's not looking, she goes even farther to seduce him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from Getchu"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c110157"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。穂之上学園二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園でトップクラスにモテる。寄ってくる男達に思わせぶりな態度を見せるが、いざ告白をされると、あっさり振る小悪魔だが詰めが甘く、ピンチに陥る事も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑛巳の弟である翔太をからかうのは、特にお気に入りのようで、瑛巳の見ていないところで、よく誘惑を繰り返してくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"24287","sourceWorkId":"32819","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヒロインの一人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"穂之上学園二年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園でトップクラスにモテる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"寄ってくる男達に思わせぶりな態度を見せるが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いざ告白をされると、あっさり振る小悪魔だが詰めが甘く、ピンチに陥る事も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑛巳の弟である翔太をからかうのは、特にお気に入りのようで、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"瑛巳の見ていないところで、よく誘惑を繰り返してくる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"115678"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a72776ed1bfd3f14452e6582d03568ac2f0b3c20c98e672d9600ea5c40227fd8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f93c60e11d24caec0d47777e742fac2a5b3161afce45d7af28c2235df5143f52.webp","width":178,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"和央 きりか","creatorId":"vndb:s1549","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1549","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1549","name":"柏木逢花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:102617","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c110158","characterName":"園原 由依子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"115679","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"387623"}],"egsCharacterIds":["24289"],"vndbCharacterId":"c110158"},"originalCharacterName":"園原 由依子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-